abstract: "A source-bounded Lean 4 preprint studying preliminary parole-revocation decisionmaker independence, evidence integrity, and prospective correction under separately represented federal and New York predicates. The artifact contains 51 audited theorems and synthetic examples. It does not authenticate external evidence or establish a judicial violation, legal cure, remedy, or outcome."
